WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.533 --> 00:00:07.700
Hey, I'm Jordan. Hosts are cancelling fourteen percent of bookings, and it costs us about three million dollars a year.

2
00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:10.067
Guests who get cancelled on rarely book again.

3
00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:12.567
Your job: find out why hosts cancel.

4
00:00:12.967 --> 00:00:18.367
Name the top reason. Back it with the data. Then tell me what the fix costs, and what it saves.

5
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:26.967
The cancellations file is in your resources. The goal is ten percent. Ian is your coach. Send me a draft when it's ready.
